&lt;p&gt;vllm-plugin-FL is installed into every vLLM app image as a prebuilt wheel from
the vendor PyPI. Most backends get a pure-Python wheel; a few get a &lt;strong&gt;native&lt;/strong&gt;
wheel that also carries a compiled &lt;code&gt;vllm_fl._C&lt;/code&gt; extension.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FlagTree</title><link>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flagtree/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flagtree/</guid><description>&lt;!--
