ships it on three channels, one backend per container, all reading one
&lt;code&gt;backends.yaml&lt;/code&gt;:&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>FlagGems</title><link>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flaggems/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/flaggems/</guid><description>&lt;!--
