&lt;p&gt;FlagLibs publishes the FlagOS &lt;strong&gt;operator libraries&lt;/strong&gt; (FlagAttention, FlagSparse,
FlagBLAS, FlagAudio, FlagFFT, FlagGems-vllm, FlagGems-sglang) as installable
wheels. Every one of them is pure Python, which shapes the whole line: the
wheels are &lt;code&gt;py3-none-any&lt;/code&gt;, so there is no vendor toolchain, no container and no
glibc floor — a plain venv script builds all of them.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Megatron</title><link>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/megatron/</link><pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate><guid>https://flagos-ai.github.io/release-info/design/megatron/</guid><description>&lt;!--
