&lt;p&gt;The SGLang app images are the runtime image plus a &lt;strong&gt;single-step
&lt;code&gt;pip install&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; of a per-vendor wheel repacked from a self-built sdist. The
native wheel would clobber the runtime&amp;rsquo;s torch matrix, so the line builds from
the &lt;strong&gt;non-CUDA (&lt;code&gt;srt_empty&lt;/code&gt;) variant&lt;/strong&gt;: its METADATA is torch-free and
&lt;code&gt;sgl-kernel&lt;/code&gt;-free by construction, and repack only stamps the &lt;code&gt;+flagos&lt;/code&gt; version
suffix.&lt;/p&gt;</description></item></channel></rss>